      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 322.32,
      "to": 324.72,
      "sid": 181,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They just outright kidnapped me in broad daylight on the street",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 324.72,
      "to": 326.08,
      "sid": 182,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and took me to the desert",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 326.08,
      "to": 327.08,
      "sid": 183,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "saving four hours",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 327.08,
      "to": 329.1,
      "sid": 184,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "by the time they let me go, it was already dark",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 329.1,
      "to": 330.82,
      "sid": 185,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the gang members dropped me off at the border",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 330.82,
      "to": 330.98,
      "sid": 186,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and said",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 330.98,
      "to": 332.78,
      "sid": 187,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "never come back to this town, ever",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 332.78,
      "to": 333.88,
      "sid": 188,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "even if it's safe here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 333.88,
      "to": 335.98,
      "sid": 189,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I really don't recommend anyone to visit this place for tourism",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 335.98,
      "to": 338.22,
      "sid": 190,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Apart from the city vibe, let's experience the locals' way of life.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 338.22,
      "to": 339.64,
      "sid": 191,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are no tourist attractions here at all.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 339.64,
      "to": 340.44,
      "sid": 192,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even so,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 340.44,
      "to": 342.58,
      "sid": 193,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "my impression of the town's residents is still not bad.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 342.58,
      "to": 344.24,
      "sid": 194,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "even the gang members who kidnapped me,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 344.24,
      "to": 345.62,
      "sid": 195,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "don't seem that bad to me.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 345.62,
      "to": 347.86,
      "sid": 196,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The specifics will be covered in another video.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 347.86,
      "to": 349.98,
      "sid": 197,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the theme of this one is still to explore a border town,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 349.98,
      "to": 351.7,
      "sid": 198,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the differences in life between two small cities.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 351.7,
      "to": 354.28,
      "sid": 199,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There were a few neighborhoods in Nuevo Laredo I wanted to visit but didn’t get to film.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 354.28,
      "to": 356.98,
      "sid": 200,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So today, I’ll stick to the route and head back to the U.S. the proper way.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 356.98,
      "to": 359.24,
      "sid": 201,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The bridge toll from Mexico to the U.S. is only five pesos.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 359.24,
      "to": 360.58,
      "sid": 202,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That’s less than two yuan.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 360.58,
      "to": 361.66,
      "sid": 203,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Pretty reasonable, actually.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 361.66,
      "to": 362.88,
      "sid": 204,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the Mexican side of the bridge,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 362.88,
      "to": 364.2,
      "sid": 205,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are quite a few street vendors.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 364.2,
      "to": 366.2,
      "sid": 206,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The process of going through U.S. Customs was fairly smooth.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 366.2,
      "to": 367.48,
      "sid": 207,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Just a bit of a difference at the border.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 367.48,
      "to": 369.799,
      "sid": 208,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Chinese people will enter the U.S. through the Laredo port of entry",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 369.799,
      "to": 372.319,
      "sid": 209,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the initial English proficiency of my assigned U.S. editor",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 372.319,
      "to": 374.039,
      "sid": 210,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "was about the same as my Spanish language skills",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 374.039,
      "to": 375.359,
      "sid": 211,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "due to the communication being so difficult",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 375.359,
      "to": 376.919,
      "sid": 212,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they eventually switched me to a different window",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 376.919,
      "to": 377.64,
      "sid": 213,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "as for Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 377.64,
      "to": 380.08,
      "sid": 214,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "U.S. census data shows that 88% of the population",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 380.08,
      "to": 381.46,
      "sid": 215,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "speak Spanish at home",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 381.46,
      "to": 384.0,
      "sid": 216,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the prevalence of Spanish here far exceeds that of Chinese",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 384.0,
      "to": 386.39,
      "sid": 217,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In places like Flushing or Chinatown",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 386.39,
      "to": 387.75,
      "sid": 218,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm inside the city of Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 387.75,
      "to": 388.35,
      "sid": 219,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the road",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 388.35,
      "to": 390.17,
      "sid": 220,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You basically don't hear English in your ears",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 390.17,
      "to": 391.87,
      "sid": 221,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, this city of 250,000 people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 391.87,
      "to": 393.39,
      "sid": 222,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "240,000 are of Latin American descent",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 393.39,
      "to": 394.31,
      "sid": 223,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Back on the American side",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 394.31,
      "to": 395.26,
      "sid": 224,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Though it's safe",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 395.26,
      "to": 396.46,
      "sid": 225,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Still, you can't help but marvel",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 396.46,
      "to": 398.54,
      "sid": 226,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The city center here is quite dilapidated and bleak.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 398.54,
      "to": 400.3,
      "sid": 227,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most stores close early.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 400.3,
      "to": 401.68,
      "sid": 228,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now, let's switch to daytime mode.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 401.68,
      "to": 403.22,
      "sid": 229,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even if you go back at noon the next day,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 403.22,
      "to": 405.3,
      "sid": 230,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "most of the store shutters are still closed.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 405.3,
      "to": 406.72,
      "sid": 231,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many are even boarded up.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 406.72,
      "to": 408.44,
      "sid": 232,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This street is far less vibrant than Mexico.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 408.44,
      "to": 409.34,
      "sid": 233,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The reason is easy to understand.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 409.34,
      "to": 410.56,
      "sid": 234,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Goods in the U.S. are just too expensive.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 410.56,
      "to": 412.56,
      "sid": 235,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And nowadays, it would be quite challenging for Mexicans to invade the U.S.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 412.56,
      "to": 413.66,
      "sid": 236,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The difficulty is still quite high.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 413.66,
      "to": 415.92,
      "sid": 237,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This old commercial street was established in the early 20th century.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 415.92,
      "to": 417.78,
      "sid": 238,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And the U.S. only really began to enforce border policies as we know them today in the 1980s.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 417.78,
      "to": 420.2,
      "sid": 239,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The modern border wall, on the other hand, started to be built gradually in the late 20th century, around the 1980s and 1990s.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 420.2,
      "to": 421.78,
      "sid": 240,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And the modern border wall didn't start to take shape until the late 20th century, in the 1980s and 1990s.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 421.78,
      "to": 424.56,
      "sid": 241,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Mexican drug cartels also began to form gradually in the 1980s.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 424.56,
      "to": 427.42,
      "sid": 242,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The border between the U.S. and Mexico used to be very different from what it is today.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 427.42,
      "to": 429.93,
      "sid": 243,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The U.S.-Mexico border used to be quite different from what it is now.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 429.93,
      "to": 431.09,
      "sid": 244,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And over the years,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 431.09,
      "to": 433.41,
      "sid": 245,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the only thing that hasn’t changed is the architectural style of the Laredo houses,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 433.41,
      "to": 436.59,
      "sid": 246,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and they also have a church next to the small plaza in the city center.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 436.59,
      "to": 438.11,
      "sid": 247,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most of the southwestern United States,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 438.11,
      "to": 440.15,
      "sid": 248,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "roughly a third of the area of the contiguous 48 states,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 440.15,
      "to": 441.45,
      "sid": 249,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "used to belong to Mexico.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 441.45,
      "to": 442.95,
      "sid": 250,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "From Mexico’s perspective,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 442.95,
      "to": 443.99,
      "sid": 251,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "before 1836,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 443.99,
      "to": 446.05,
      "sid": 252,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "55% of its territory was ceded to the United States.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 446.05,
      "to": 448.49,
      "sid": 253,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This Laredo town was originally part of Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 448.49,
      "to": 450.25,
      "sid": 254,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Later, after it was incorporated into U.S. territory",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 450.25,
      "to": 451.68,
      "sid": 255,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "17 Laredo families",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 451.68,
      "to": 454.38,
      "sid": 256,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "chose to retain their Mexican citizenship and culture",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 454.38,
      "to": 455.82,
      "sid": 257,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and did not want to be governed by the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 455.82,
      "to": 457.04,
      "sid": 258,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "crossed what is now the border river",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 457.04,
      "to": 459.039,
      "sid": 259,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the Rio Grande to establish Nuevo Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 459.039,
      "to": 461.699,
      "sid": 260,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is why these two cities are so similar",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 461.699,
      "to": 464.199,
      "sid": 261,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now let’s take a look at places outside the center of Nuevo Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 464.199,
      "to": 467.2,
      "sid": 262,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Actually, the city as a whole has a somewhat rundown feel.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 467.2,
      "to": 469.82,
      "sid": 263,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The housing prices here are only 3/2 of the average in Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 469.82,
      "to": 470.72,
      "sid": 264,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Compared to Nuevo Laredo,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 470.72,
      "to": 472.24,
      "sid": 265,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the houses here are more spread out,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 472.24,
      "to": 473.28,
      "sid": 266,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the roads are wider.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 473.28,
      "to": 475.42,
      "sid": 267,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, most Americans travel by car.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 475.42,
      "to": 476.48,
      "sid": 268,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After driving around this area,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 476.48,
      "to": 477.3,
      "sid": 269,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "leaving aside the safety issues,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 477.3,
      "to": 480.06,
      "sid": 270,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I can’t help but feel that this side of the U.S. looks less appealing than Mexico.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 480.06,
      "to": 482.74,
      "sid": 271,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Don't be fooled by the fact that Laredo and Nuevo Laredo together have a population of only 600,000.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 482.74,
      "to": 485.7,
      "sid": 272,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In reality, this is the most crucial freight port on the U.S.-Mexico border.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 485.7,
      "to": 487.72,
      "sid": 273,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Railways can be seen everywhere in this small city.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 487.72,
      "to": 489.98,
      "sid": 274,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "47% of the goods shipped from the U.S. to Mexico and",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 489.98,
      "to": 492.12,
      "sid": 275,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "36% of the goods shipped from Mexico to the U.S.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 492.12,
      "to": 494.8,
      "sid": 276,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "all pass through the Laredo-Nuevo Laredo port of entry.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 494.8,
      "to": 496.84,
      "sid": 277,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is because Laredo is the starting point of the major U.S. highway artery,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 496.84,
      "to": 498.76,
      "sid": 278,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Interstate 35,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 498.76,
      "to": 499.96,
      "sid": 279,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which connects to the three largest cities in Texas.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 499.96,
      "to": 500.44,
      "sid": 280,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Dallas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 500.44,
      "to": 501.12,
      "sid": 281,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "San Antonio",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 501.12,
      "to": 502.06,
      "sid": 282,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is quite close to Houston",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 502.06,
      "to": 503.06,
      "sid": 283,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "if you take the highway",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 503.06,
      "to": 505.26,
      "sid": 284,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is the fastest route from Mexico to the eastern United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 505.26,
      "to": 507.48,
      "sid": 285,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The Laredo border crossing has seen particularly rapid growth recently",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 507.48,
      "to": 508.66,
      "sid": 286,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "mainly due to the trade war",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 508.66,
      "to": 510.82,
      "sid": 287,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many Chinese companies have set up factories in Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 510.82,
      "to": 512.46,
      "sid": 288,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many choose locations south of Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 512.46,
      "to": 514.2,
      "sid": 289,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Monterrey, the ninth largest city in Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 514.2,
      "to": 516.36,
      "sid": 290,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has relatively better security",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 516.36,
      "to": 519.44,
      "sid": 291,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and a lot of goods heading north from Monterrey pass through Laredo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 519.44,
      "to": 520.44,
      "sid": 292,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "when I went to Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 520.44,
      "to": 522.2,
      "sid": 293,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it was along this road leading to the border crossing",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 522.2,
      "to": 523.559,
      "sid": 294,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that I exchanged 80 dollars for pesos",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 523.559,
      "to": 525.459,
      "sid": 295,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I originally planned to stay in Mexico for two days",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 525.459,
      "to": 526.679,
      "sid": 296,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but ended up doing a day trip",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 526.679,
      "to": 527.699,
      "sid": 297,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I had no other choice",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 527.699,
      "to": 529.479,
      "sid": 298,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, Mexican food is quite delicious.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 529.479,
      "to": 531.2,
      "sid": 299,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And it's much cheaper than in the U.S.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 531.2,
      "to": 533.16,
      "sid": 300,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now I can only visit Laredo in the U.S. once.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 533.16,
      "to": 534.2,
      "sid": 301,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To find some alternatives.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 534.2,
      "to": 537.0,
      "sid": 302,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In fact, most restaurants in Laredo also serve Mexican cuisine.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 537.0,
      "to": 539.8,
      "sid": 303,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I found a small family restaurant located in a residential area.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 539.8,
      "to": 540.48,
      "sid": 304,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Laredo,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 540.48,
      "to": 542.0,
      "sid": 305,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most people only speak Spanish.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 542.0,
      "to": 543.14,
      "sid": 306,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Including the owner of this restaurant.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 543.14,
      "to": 544.97,
      "sid": 307,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Only the kids in the store speak English",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 544.97,
      "to": 547.01,
      "sid": 308,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Generally, the flavor of this kind of store is quite authentic",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 547.01,
      "to": 548.79,
      "sid": 309,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I ordered something called Ranch Style Eggs",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 548.79,
      "to": 549.57,
      "sid": 310,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "served with bacon",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 549.57,
      "to": 550.85,
      "sid": 311,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "fried potato cubes and black-eyed peas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 550.85,
      "to": 552.53,
      "sid": 312,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I really like the sauce they mix here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 552.53,
      "to": 554.14,
      "sid": 313,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a tangy and spicy tomato sauce",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 554.14,
      "to": 556.12,
      "sid": 314,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most of the items on their menu are single-digit priced",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 556.12,
      "to": 557.6,
      "sid": 315,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "My meal costs six yuan",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 557.6,
      "to": 559.29,
      "sid": 316,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you think it's worth it, tap one; if not, tap two.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 559.29,
      "to": 561.79,
      "sid": 317,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then I also tried a local Chinese restaurant that people love.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 561.79,
      "to": 564.28,
      "sid": 318,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This place is just a 5-minute drive from the border.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 564.28,
      "to": 566.6,
      "sid": 319,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The name translates to 'Borderline Chinese Restaurant'.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 566.6,
      "to": 567.48,
      "sid": 320,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "United States and Mexico.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 567.48,
      "to": 569.24,
      "sid": 321,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A mix of dishes from three countries: China, the U.S., and Mexico.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 569.24,
      "to": 570.72,
      "sid": 322,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I didn't expect it to be this abstract.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 570.72,
      "to": 573.38,
      "sid": 323,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I ordered a classic American-Chinese dish,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 573.38,
      "to": 574.18,
      "sid": 324,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "General Tso's Chicken.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 574.18,
      "to": 576.1,
      "sid": 325,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the sauce was way too dark,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 576.1,
      "to": 577.04,
      "sid": 326,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and too thick.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 577.04,
      "to": 578.32,
      "sid": 327,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even the complimentary hot and sour soup.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 578.32,
      "to": 580.22,
      "sid": 328,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I suspect they use soy sauce like it's free here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 580.22,
      "to": 582.96,
      "sid": 329,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I don't really understand why so many people come to eat this Chinese food.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 582.96,
      "to": 585.34,
      "sid": 330,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Finally, let's check out the Mexican supermarket on the Laredo side.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 585.34,
      "to": 588.14,
      "sid": 331,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The biggest feature here is the imported Mexican beverages.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 588.14,
      "to": 589.34,
      "sid": 332,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The owner, noticing I was from out of town,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 589.34,
      "to": 591.32,
      "sid": 333,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "kindly offered me a cup of coffee.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 591.32,
      "to": 594.14,
      "sid": 334,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The Walmart on the Laredo side has also made some local adaptations.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 594.14,
      "to": 594.62,
      "sid": 335,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As you enter,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 594.62,
      "to": 595.12,
      "sid": 336,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this mural,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 595.12,
      "to": 597.86,
      "sid": 337,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "reflects the history of the area where Mexico and the U.S. meet.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 597.86,
      "to": 599.76,
      "sid": 338,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They also sell city commemorative hoodies here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 599.76,
      "to": 602.4,
      "sid": 339,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the shelves are filled with all sorts of Mexican goods.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 602.4,
      "to": 602.84,
      "sid": 340,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Laredo,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 602.84,
      "to": 605.46,
      "sid": 341,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which is actually located in the rugged Texas,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 605.46,
      "to": 608.5,
      "sid": 342,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has rows of Texas and American flags on the store roofs.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 608.5,
      "to": 611.34,
      "sid": 343,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although this place is a bit different from the traditional redneck Texas,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 611.34,
      "to": 613.64,
      "sid": 344,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "all the products here are quite large,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 613.64,
      "to": 616.04,
      "sid": 345,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like this 4-liter juice and 3-liter cola,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 616.04,
      "to": 617.22,
      "sid": 346,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which are Texas exclusives.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 617.22,
      "to": 620.2,
      "sid": 347,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The border between Texas and Mexico is over 2,000 kilometers long,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 620.2,
      "to": 622.84,
      "sid": 348,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and Laredo is actually a fairly well-developed small city.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 622.84,
      "to": 624.68,
      "sid": 349,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In the next episode, I'll take you to see even more remote,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 624.68,
      "to": 626.36,
      "sid": 350,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "decayed Texas border towns.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 626.36,
      "to": 626.76,
      "sid": 351,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Alright,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 626.76,
      "to": 627.96,
      "sid": 352,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that's it for this video.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 627.96,
      "to": 628.4,
      "sid": 353,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Follow me,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 628.4,
      "to": 630.92,
      "sid": 354,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and I'll take you to explore more places that ordinary people don't venture into.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    }
  ]
}